# Test/model data — never committed (populate locally via data/get-test-data.ps1)
data/**
!data/README.md
!data/get-test-data.ps1
*.ifc
*.bos
*.parquet
*.duckdb
!samples/tables/*.duckdb

# The patterns above match any path component by name, case-insensitively on
# Windows, so a project directory such as src/BimOpenFlow.Nodes.Bos or
# src/Ara3D.BimOpenSchema.DuckDb would otherwise be excluded whole — which forces
# `git add -f` and sweeps build output into the commit. Re-include every directory
# under src/ and tests/ so only actual data *files* stay ignored.
!src/**/
!tests/**/

# Build output — last, so it wins over the re-includes above.
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
node_modules/
dist/
*.user
*.log

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
